  "body": "Looks like the final state of the tokenizer is not used by the parser,\nand the only other potential reason to keep those reconsumption steps\nis obsolete as per #1058.\n\n---\n\nAs per @inikulin's suggestion, this is kind of reopen of #1268 but without the controversial action-at-a-distance, and instead just avoiding extra reconsumption in favor of explicit EOF emit.\n",
